  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The cross aldol reaction takes place between isobutyraldehyde and formaldehyde&nbsp;to&nbsp;get hydroxypivaldehyde. On reaction with hydrogen cyanide&nbsp;followed by hydrolysis produces the lactone product.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0055_826a951d8894.png\" style=\"width: 497px; height: 242px;\" /></p>"
